      "value": "<p>&gt;@UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.class-features.Item.zKnRX8ZuVhyvC29H]{Detective}</p>\n<p>At 11th level, your incredible insights help you move investigations forward where mundane inquiries fail. Once per day, you can spend 1 Resolve Point and take 10 minutes pondering a mystery or quandary to gain an enigmatic insight as if you had cast @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.APgLb0BS0VgtE06l]{Divination} (though the result is often presented as a cryptic clue).</p>"
